<title>GERMANY: German May prod. prices +0.2 pct m/m, +1.1 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>German May prod. prices +0.2 pct m/m, +1.1 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES   May 97	Apr 97	 May 96</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.2	  +0.3	   unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.1	  +0.9	   -0.5</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  104.6	 104.4	  103.5</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.1	  +0.4	   unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.0	  +0.9	   -0.7</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  104.1	 104.0	  103.1</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.6	  +0.3	   -0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +2.4	  +1.6	   +1.2</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  110.7	 110.0	  108.1</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
